libfprint-oms-driver

Project source: LGPL-2.1-or-later. See LICENSE.
The integration patch modifies libfprint v1.94.100, also LGPL-2.1-or-later.
Upstream: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libfprint/libfprint
Preserve upstream copyright and license notices when distributing the prepared source.

Upstream libfprint is downloaded separately with a pinned SHA-256 checksum.
This repository does not distribute vendor Windows software, firmware, decompiled
vendor source, raw USB captures, or personal fingerprint records.

Protocol behavior was studied for interoperability with OMS/OFilm hardware using
USB observations and analysis of the vendor Windows driver. This is an independent,
unofficial project and is not endorsed by OMS, OFilm, MECHREVO, or libfprint.
Hardware testing and initial project work: xiecheesejohn.
Some implementation and documentation were developed with AI assistance.
